    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><table class=\"wikitable\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <th>CANNON</th>\n   <th>DAMAGE</th>\n   <th>EMPLACEMENT POINTS</th>\n   <th>AVAILABILITY</th>\n   <th>COST</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Double</td>\n   <td>+1d10</td>\n   <td>0</td>\n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Licensed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Licensed\">Licensed</a></td>\n   <td>x3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Quad</td>\n   <td>+2d10</td>\n   <td>1</td>\n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Restricted\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Restricted\">Restricted</a></td>\n   <td>x5</td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p>Double and Quad versions of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Cannon_(Vehicles)\" title=\"Blaster Cannon (Vehicles)\">Blaster Cannons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Cannon\" title=\"Laser Cannon\">Laser Cannons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion_Cannon\" title=\"Ion Cannon\">Ion Cannons</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Turbolaser\" title=\"Turbolaser\">Turbolasers</a> are available, creating reciprocating multibarrel weapons. A Double or Quad Cannon has the given availability, or the availability of it's base <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon System\">Weapon System</a>, whichever is more restrictive.</p><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Autofire\"><b>Autofire</b></span></h4><p>Double or Quad <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Cannon_(Vehicles)\" title=\"Blaster Cannon (Vehicles)\">Blaster Cannons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Cannon\" title=\"Laser Cannon\">Laser Cannons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Light_Ion_Cannon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Ion Cannon\">Light Ion Cannons</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Light_Turbolaser\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Turbolaser\">Light Turbolasers</a> can fire normally or in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> mode, with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> required to switch between the two.</p><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Triple_Cannons\"><b>Triple Cannons</b></span></h4><p>Some Starships also carry Triple Cannons. These are functionally identical to Double Cannons, using three cannons (with slightly less power individually) instead of two standard cannons.</p>",
